	<item>
		<title>JaWsome Premium Fresh Grass Fed 18kg Pack</title>
		<link>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/jawsome-premium-fresh-grass-fed-18kg-pack/</link>
					<comments>https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/jawsome-premium-fresh-grass-fed-18kg-pack/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[farmerbutcher_t66bou]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 04:26:23 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://farmerbutcher.com.au/?post_type=product&#038;p=12487</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>18kg Fresh beef pack. Yearling grain assisted beef, aged for 2 weeks prior to cut up. No bones or trim, just high quality, national award winning beef. Farmer produced and farmer delivered. Free delivery with this pack!</p>
<p>Please note that due to carcass weight variation, packs may differ slightly. However, our aim is to provide the following in each pack, with a guaranteed minimum of 18kg total product.</p>
<ul>
<li>2 x 2 T-bone steak</li>
<li>2 x 2 Scotch fillet steak</li>
<li>2 x 2 Rump steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Eye fillet steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Round steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Blade steak boneless or bone-in steaks</li>
<li>1 x Topside roast</li>
<li>1 x Silverside corned</li>
<li>1 x 1kg Diced beef</li>
<li>3 x 1kg Mince</li>
<li>3 x 1kg plain thin sausages</li>
</ul>
<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/jawsome-premium-fresh-grass-fed-18kg-pack/">JaWsome Premium Fresh Grass Fed 18kg Pack</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The post <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au/product/jawsome-premium-fresh-grass-fed-18kg-pack/">JaWsome Premium Fresh Grass Fed 18kg Pack</a> appeared first on <a href="https://farmerbutcher.com.au">Farmer Butcher</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
