					<description><![CDATA[<p><strong>JaWsome Produce</strong> supplies beef, honey, eggs, bacon, lamb, soughdough and olives from the Namoi Valley of NSW. The BEEF AUSTRALIA nationally award winning beef, honey and eggs are supplied from the farm of Lachlan and Kate James and family. Lamb, bacon, soughdough and olives are sourced from local farming families across the Namoi Valley.</p>
<div><b>6kg Fresh beef pack</b>. Yearling grain assisted beef, aged for 2 weeks prior to cut up. No bones or trim, just high quality, national award winning beef.</div>
