<ul>
<li>1 x 2 T-bone steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Scotch fillet steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Rump steak</li>
<li>1 x 2 Round steak or Blade steak</li>
<li>3 x 500g Mince</li>
<li>3 x 500g plain thin sausages</li>
</ul>
